    <p>Generic online advice can only go so far. A homeowner does not just need to know what a garage conversion is. They need to know whether it may make sense for their property.</p>
    <p>A basic property preview can help look at:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>garage location</li>
      <li>driveway access</li>
      <li>distance from main house</li>
      <li>possible entrance location</li>
      <li>yard impact</li>
      <li>privacy</li>
      <li>visible utility questions</li>
      <li>possible detached vs garage conversion direction</li>
      <li>questions to ask a contractor before a site visit</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This is not official approval. It is not architecture or engineering. But it can help homeowners understand what path may be worth exploring before inviting contractors into the home.</p>
  </section>

