  <section class="reminder">
    <h2>Simple Reminder</h2>
    <p>A garage conversion can be smart.</p>
    <p>A garage conversion can also become expensive if the wrong details are ignored.</p>
    <p>Before you trust the cheapest quote, understand the condition of the garage, the utility work, the permit path, and the real scope.</p>
    <p>Do not let someone sell you &ldquo;easy&rdquo; before they explain the details.</p>
